  },
  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoon butter (salted)",
    "1 1/2 tablespoon erythritol",
    "2 tablespoon unsweetened dark cocoa powder",
    "2 teaspoon coconut flour",
    "2 tablespoon almond flour",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 large egg"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out the butter and put it inside the mug you will be using. This should be at least a 12 oz mug.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-cake-mug/#wprm-recipe-50665-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/MeasureOutButter.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microwave the butter for 20-25 seconds until it is mostly melted and hot. Add the sweetener to the melted butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-cake-mug/#wprm-recipe-50665-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/AddErythritoltoCake.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cocoa powder to the butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-cake-mug/#wprm-recipe-50665-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/CocoaPowderMix.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the coconut flour, almond flour, baking powder, and vanilla.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-cake-mug/#wprm-recipe-50665-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/AddAlmondFlourCoconutFlourBakingPowder.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't forget the egg! It will help the cake rise.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-cake-mug/#wprm-recipe-50665-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/AddEggtoKetoMugCake.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix the ingredients well, until everything is combined and there's as few lumps as you can get. If you're going to make 2 servings, this is the point where you would measure the batter out into 2 mugs or 2 ramekins.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-cake-mug/#wprm-recipe-50665-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/MixIngredientsVeryWell.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microwave the cake for 60-75 seconds. It takes 75 seconds in my microwave. If you are making 2 servings, probably 50-60 seconds would do the best - I never make 2 servings because I'm greedy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-cake-mug/#wprm-recipe-50665-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/MicrowaveMugCake.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While you're waiting for the cake to cook, whip some cream in a mixing bowl. (Optional)",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-cake-mug/#wprm-recipe-50665-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/MakeQuickWhippedCream.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let the cake cool for a moment and spoon on the whipped cream. (Optional)",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-cake-mug/#wprm-recipe-50665-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
